# POC-VMS-41 runner audit checklist

- [ ] CLI defaults to zero-model preflight; live calls require explicit `--execute`.
- [ ] Frozen manifest hashes, exact model/profile, four attempts and zero retry are checked.
- [ ] The real user-level Devin `AGENTS.md` is treated as a visible frozen control surface; absent/hash/size drift blocks before a model process starts.
- [ ] Production output is a new append-once child of the approved D-volume root.
- [ ] Every attempt writes a pre-start receipt and append-only attempt event log.
- [ ] Any surviving partial attempt blocks relaunch and requires reconciliation.
- [ ] Hidden acceptable-set grading starts only after all four calls are terminal.
- [ ] Tool calls, workspace file set, source identity and model observability fail closed.
- [ ] Zero observable tool events is `UNOBSERVABLE`, never a clean tool-boundary PASS.
- [ ] Mechanical PASS remains pending manual semantic audit.
- [ ] No DB, Redis, Seven, Target Solver, network or subagent call is made.
